Thou art the author of thy rage,
And I, a coward, reluctant to be harsh,
Leanly infer that thee hate'st me.
Be thou the tenth slave, ten times more in worth
Than those old nine whose decrees I uphold,
And I, making thee do the pleasing,
Join with those nine to one degree increase;
  Receiving nought by nine but thine own will,
  But by nine thou hast ten times as much pleasure gained.


