In my faith there is no difference
Nor worshipping of things above;
All alike for my heart there reigns love,
And for my faith no lower thing saith.
Thy love is thine and for thy sake
All days of my life are spent;
For all I want is thy heart,
And all I require is thine open door.
  If I do not push forward contrary
