One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch
Of her prized services. Then, if ever, whenever
A white hand held its sharpened sword,
The color with which it was dyed
Were nearly their principal color;
If ever they be recured,
They look fresh, and Robinson says
They live in sweetest health.
  If they be dead, their clothes are
  And linen of most fine feature degrades.


