Love is too young to know what conscience is;
Yet who knows not conscience is born of love?
Then, gentle cheater, urge not my amiss,
But when I think on thee, thou dost foist upon my love's gain,
And make myself old offenses of affections new.
O, that I am that I am; and they that level
